  "instruction": "Claude r15 (2026-09-27): in-game event calendar (text menu board, design ingame/설계_v3_글메뉴판.md). Payload AIN only (PACT/EX untouched); KR_T9* functions appended; no original function relocated; nine same-length CALLFUNC operand swaps: C_SceneHomebase@RunHome ■選択ダイアログ／実行 -> KR_T9HomeMenuRun (a queued replay returns 3 without showing the menu, otherwise the original run; the r13 pick code marks context P); C_SceneHomebase@CheckGameSysButtons ■カジュアルモード設定呼び出し -> KR_T9HomeCasual (replays the queued event with the game's own path LSys3xScript::Prepare(name) + RunEvent + ■ＡＤＶ消し(true, 0), otherwise the original casual call) and ▲コンフィグ実行 -> KR_T9HomeConfig (context C while the settings opened from the home base run; a reservation made inside is armed only after they return); KR_T8CharMissingMenu ■選択ダイアログ／タイトル設定 -> KR_T9CharMenuTitle (adds item 1 이벤트 달력), ■選択ダイアログ／実行 -> KR_T9CharMenuRun, KR_T8CharMissingPage -> KR_T9CharMenuPage; KR_T8CharMissingPage the 2nd ■選択ダイアログ／選択肢追加 -> KR_T9CharPageAdd (adds item 3 달력으로 보기), ■選択ダイアログ／実行 -> KR_T9CharPageRun, KR_T8CharDatePage -> KR_T9CharDate. Names and addresses of KR_T8* and Codex functions are unchanged. Saved stacks: a save made during a calendar replay holds C_SceneHomebase@Run > CheckGameSysButtons > KR_T9HomeCasual > LSys3xScript::RunEvent > event: keep KR_T9HomeCasual (index, address, code) and CheckGameSysButtons in place in every later build, and KR_T9HomeConfig as a precaution; such a save cannot be loaded by a runtime without KR_T9HomeCasual. State lives only in SystemService variables YoruKR.T9.* (never saved); no globals, structs or save schema change. Tables are baked from chart/build_chart_v2.py (155 cards, 760 drawer scenes, 1,164 events): rebuild r15 when the chart data changes. A later rebuild of RunHome, CheckGameSysButtons, KR_T8CharMissingMenu or KR_T8CharMissingPage must keep these calls. Every earlier contract stays in force.",
